# ---- deployment defaults (BH-4080) -------------------------------------------
# Values specific to the deployment this harness runs on. Each has ONE default,
# in bin/lib/deployment.sh (registered in catalog/lanes.d/_lib.deployment.json,
# none settable from the console), and that default is the original fleet's
# value. Another operator sets the ones that differ here. Leave them commented
# to keep the defaults. docs/config-inventory/deployment.md lists who reads each.
#
# The harness's own repo (owner/name) and the GitHub owner the App mints for by
# default (unset: the owner half of HARNESS_REPO).
#HARNESS_REPO=
#HARNESS_GH_OWNER=
# The operator's GitHub login: the PR author and verdict author sets.
#HARNESS_OPERATOR_LOGIN=
# The commit identity a box falls back to when it has no global git identity.
#HARNESS_GIT_NAME=
#HARNESS_GIT_EMAIL=
# The committer name on the merge lanes' own merges (MC_GIT_NAME still wins).
#HARNESS_MERGE_GIT_NAME=
# The harness bot's commit identity (verification-map retrofits, rebase fixups).
#HARNESS_BOT_GIT_NAME=
#HARNESS_BOT_GIT_EMAIL=
# The workers.dev subdomain the jobs and locks workers fall back to when
# JOBS_URL / LOCKS_URL are unset.
#HARNESS_WORKERS_SUBDOMAIN=
# Box naming: a fleet.conf row with no box column is owned by
# <prefix><project minus -os>; the hub's fleet name when HUB_BOX_NAME is unset.
#HARNESS_BOX_PREFIX=
#HARNESS_HUB_BOX=
